{"id":"660504","name":"子姜鸭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660504/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"子姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸭肉处理好后沥干水份备用。","img":"images/660504/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"子姜洗净切细备用。","img":"images/660504/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油倒入鸭肉。","img":"images/660504/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火将鸭肉的水份炒干。","img":"images/660504/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐。","img":"images/660504/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/660504/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/660504/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖40分钟左右。","img":"images/660504/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分钟后鸭肉已焖软烂入味。","img":"images/660504/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入子姜。","img":"images/660504/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀再焖五分钟左右即可出锅。","img":"images/660504/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660504/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660504/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660504/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}